From: Billit dev <dev@example.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 11:37:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Migrate local storage from Hive to SQLite

- Add lib/data: schema, entity/key-value stores, platform connections
  (native sqlite3, web WASM on IndexedDB) and a one-time Hive importer
- Replace Hive boxes/adapters/HiveObject across models, services, screens
- Run backup restore in a single transaction
- Add sqlite3 3.7.1 + web/sqlite3.wasm; drop hive_flutter, hive_generator, build_runner
- Add database and legacy import tests plus a legacy fixture generator
- Update README and Copilot instructions
